{"seq":2,"slug":"biological-anthropology","title":"体质人类学","stage":"DONE","category":"anthropology","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/biological-anthropology","rating":{"composite":3.73,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":2.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":2.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.2,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"体质人类学-简介\">体质人类学 简介</h1><p>体质人类学（又称生物人类学）从<strong>生物学视角</strong>研究人类：我们如何作为一个物种演化而来、人类群体之间为何存在遗传与形态差异、人体如何与环境共同适应，以及现代健康问题如何根植于远古的演化遗产。它以化石、基因组、活体灵长类与人体测量为证据，回答&quot;我们从哪里来&quot;&quot;人类为何如此多样&quot;&quot;身体为何这样设计&quot;这类根本问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>人类学是一门四分支学科，体质人类学是其中以&quot;生物/演化&quot;为底色的一支。与几个最易混淆的兄弟 hub 的边界如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>hub</th>\n<th>关注核心</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>本 hub：体质人类学</strong></td>\n<td>人类的生物演化、遗传、形态适应、灵长类比较、进化医学</td>\n<td>以<strong>生物学证据</strong>（化石/基因/解剖）为主线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../cultural-anthropology/\">文化人类学</a></td>\n<td>习俗、信仰、社会结构、意义系统</td>\n<td>研究<strong>习得的文化</strong>而非生物遗传</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../archaeological-anthropology/\">考古人类学</a></td>\n<td>通过物质遗存重建过去社会</td>\n<td>关注<strong>文化遗存与文明</strong>；本 hub 关注<strong>人体化石与演化</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../medical-anthropology/\">医学人类学</a></td>\n<td>疾病的社会文化建构、医疗体系、健康不平等</td>\n<td>从<strong>社会文化</strong>看健康；本 hub 从<strong>演化生物学</strong>看健康（进化医学）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../environmental-anthropology/\">环境人类学</a></td>\n<td>人与环境的文化关系、生态知识、气候议题</td>\n<td>关注<strong>文化生态</strong>；本 hub 关注<strong>生物适应</strong>（高海拔、肤色等）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话区分：凡是落在&quot;基因、化石、骨骼、灵长类、身体适应&quot;上的，归本 hub；凡落在&quot;意义、习俗、制度、物质文化&quot;上的，归其它分支。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三章结构与推荐学习路径\">三章结构与推荐学习路径</h2><p>本 hub 三章层层递进，构成从<strong>宏观演化 → 微观遗传 → 行为与应用</strong>的完整链条：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 人类起源与演化</strong> — 演化时间线与化石方法论的基础，含<a href=\"human-evolution/human-origins-and-evolution\">人类起源与进化</a>、<a href=\"human-evolution/paleoanthropology-and-fossils\">古人类学与化石研究</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 遗传与多样性</strong> — 在演化框架上深入分子与群体层面，含<a href=\"genetics-and-diversity/population-genetics-diversity\">人类群体与遗传多样性</a>、<a href=\"genetics-and-diversity/human-morphology-adaptation\">人体形态与适应机制</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 灵长类与健康</strong> — 把视角延伸到活体比较与现实应用，含<a href=\"primates-and-health/primate-behavior-ecology\">灵长类行为与生态</a>、<a href=\"primates-and-health/health-disease-nutrition\">健康、疾病与营养人类学</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>按人群推荐：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>入门者 / 通识读者</strong>：按章节顺序通读，第一章建立时间线后再进二、三章。重点把握&quot;双足行走早于脑容量&quot;&quot;种族不是有效生物学分类&quot;&quot;适应性失配&quot;三个核心观念。</li>\n<li><strong>生物学 / 医学背景</strong>：可先跳读第二、三章（遗传多样性、人体适应、进化医学），再回溯第一章补足化石与演化脉络。</li>\n<li><strong>想做交叉研究者</strong>：每篇文末的「延伸阅读与跨学科链接」直接连向<a href=\"../../biology-life-science/evolutionary-biology/evo-devo/human-evolution\">演化生物学</a>、<a href=\"../../biology-life-science/genetics-and-genomics/classical-genetics/population-genetics\">群体遗传学</a>、<a href=\"../../psychology/cultural-cross-cultural-psychology/evolutionary-psychology/evolutionary-foundations\">演化心理学</a>与<a href=\"../../environmental-science/conservation-biology/conservation-strategies/species-recovery\">保护生物学</a>，可据兴趣横向展开。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>本 hub 不要求专业背景，但具备以下基础会更顺畅：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>演化论基本概念</strong>：自然选择、遗传、变异、共同祖先。若不熟，建议先读<a href=\"../../biology-life-science/evolutionary-biology/evolutionary-mechanisms/natural-selection\">自然选择</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>遗传学常识</strong>：基因、等位基因、DNA、突变。第二章会用到 Hardy-Weinberg 平衡、Fst 等概念，可对照<a href=\"../../biology-life-science/genetics-and-genomics/classical-genetics/population-genetics\">群体遗传学</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>基本地质年代感</strong>：百万年级别的时间尺度，以及&quot;放射性测年&quot;的直觉。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>无相关背景的读者也完全可以从第一章读起——文中会随用随解释关键术语。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"human-evolution","title":"人类起源与演化","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/biological-anthropology/human-evolution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"human-origins-and-evolution","title":"人类起源与进化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/biological-anthropology/human-evolution/human-origins-and-evolution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"paleoanthropology-and-fossils","title":"古人类学与化石研究","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/biological-anthropology/human-evolution/paleoanthropology-and-fossils"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"genetics-and-diversity","title":"遗传与多样性","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/biological-anthropology/genetics-and-diversity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"population-genetics-diversity","title":"人类群体与遗传多样性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/biological-anthropology/genetics-and-diversity/population-genetics-diversity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"human-morphology-adaptation","title":"人体形态与适应机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/biological-anthropology/genetics-and-diversity/human-morphology-adaptation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"primates-and-health","title":"灵长类与健康","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/biological-anthropology/primates-and-health","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"primate-behavior-ecology","title":"灵长类行为与生态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/biological-anthropology/primates-and-health/primate-behavior-ecology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"health-disease-nutrition","title":"健康、疾病与营养人类学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/biological-anthropology/primates-and-health/health-disease-nutrition"}]}]}